<title>USA: MascoTech to redeem preferred stock.</title>
<headline>MascoTech to redeem preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>TAYLOR, Mich. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MascoTech Inc said Thursday it is calling all of its $1.20 convertible preferred stock for redemption on June 27.</p>
<p>In a release dated June 11, each share will be redeemed for 0.955 share of MascoTech common stock. The ratio includes the accrued dividends to the redemption date, paid in stock.</p>
<p>Because of the redemption, the company said it will issue about 9.9 million shares of MascoTech common stock.</p>
<p>The Bank of New York will act as redemption and conversion agent.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
